+// Double turns through turn priority (owner 9 Nov: double turning is important; GR:126-131, interactions.md:14-24: a set priority acts
+// from next round; the n-th bodies of the two teams pair and their order flips each round). Read once a round in
+// set_dynamic_turn_priority, flag first; 0 = nova_base_v662. Priority values stay <= DT_CAP (under R1/R3's 40).
+// DTS (b1777, spec_dts_1109 STRIKE) bit 1: FIGHT, focus F already acted this round, F within my range + 1, my burst now plus a basic
+// next turn >= F's eff HP and no visible foe kills me next turn: take the lowest priority that puts me before F next round (two of my
+// turns, no F turn between).
+// DTD (b1777, spec_dtd_1109 DENY) bit 1: a visible foe still to act this round that also acts before me next round (two turns before
+// my next) with two-turn damage >= DTD_PCT % of my eff HP: take the lowest priority that puts me before it next round.
+#define DT_CAP 39
+#define DTS_BITS 0
+inline const volatile int DTS_TAB[2] = { 0x44545331, DTS_BITS }; // slot 0 magic keeps it out of .bss
+#define DTS_ON(b) ((DTS_TAB[1] & (b)) != 0)
+#define DTD_BITS 0
+#define DTD_PCT 60
+inline const volatile int DTD_TAB[3] = { 0x44544431, DTD_BITS, DTD_PCT }; // slot 0 magic keeps it out of .bss
+#define DTD_ON(b) ((DTD_TAB[1] & (b)) != 0)
+// ALT (b1777, owner's idea via spec_alt_1109): alternate our order, inverted on even rounds and regular on odd ones (the value set in
+// round r applies from r + 1, GR:130), only where no override (40 escape / 35 finish / DTS / DTD) set the value; Issac's order after it.
+// Bit 1 ALT-TEAM every body; bit 2 ALT-FIGHT only in FIGHT with a focus. 0 = nova_base_v662.
+#define ALT_BITS 0
+inline const volatile int ALT_TAB[2] = { 0x414C5431, ALT_BITS }; // slot 0 magic keeps it out of .bss
+#define ALT_ON(b) ((ALT_TAB[1] & (b)) != 0)
